  of new lesions), no change (change inbooks.google.com"}, {"study_index": 7, "title": "Randomized phase II studies of  
  cisplatin and a combination of cyclophosphamide‐doxorubicin‐cisplatin (CAP) in patients with progestin‐refractory     
  advanced endometrial carcinoma", "abstract": "Between May 1980 and September 1983, 30 progestin-refractory patients   
