  the published literature with survival-type endpoints."}, {"study_index": 12, "title": "Phase III comparison of       
  methotrexate, vinblastine, doxorubicin, and cisplatin (MVAC) vs. doxorubicin and cisplatin (AC) in women with         
  advanced primary or recurrent metastatic carcinoma of the uterine endometrium", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES The North     
