  considered as a standard for treatment in this patient population."}, {"study_index": 13, "title": "Phase III trial   
  of doxorubicin plus cisplatin with or without paclitaxel plus filgrastim in advanced endometrial carcinoma: a         
  Gynecologic Oncology Group Study", "abstract": "PURPOSE To determine whether the addition of paclitaxel to            
