  =.14); whereas in MIC2, median survival time was 6.7 months (CT + PC) compared with 4. 8 months (PC alone) (P =.03).  
  QOL, assessed in 134 patients from start of trial to week 6, showed improvement with chemotherapy and deterioration   
  with standard treatment. In the combined analysis of 797 randomized patients, the positive effect of MIC on survival  
